            { "opt.Enabled.L", "Enable TransitTimetables" },
            { "opt.Enabled.D", "Master switch for the whole mod. Off = exact vanilla: every line stops being managed (any held buses are released and the mod-applied fleet count and unbunching factor are reverted), while your per-line timetables are kept so re-enabling resumes them. On by default." },
